m/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":108743873,"digest":"sha256:4d4857aa9559338c366a37634c46ed9bf503d1a0d2094d52dd3680a8b309618b","download_count":8,"created_at":"2026-04-27T23:01:18Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T23:02:32Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.4.0/Advancely-v1.4.0-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.4.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.4.0","body":"# Advancely COOP is FINALLY Here!\r\n\r\n### Advancely now fully supports coop across EVERY single Minecraft version, even legacy. You may now connect either locally through the same network or through Advancely's Official Server by just using a room code and password.\r\n\r\nOnce you and you're friends are connected everyone can either look a merged view, where all goals are combined based off of goal merging rules or look at each view individually. Even manual completions like custom goals and setting checkboxes for stats is now fully UUID-based and thus individual per player, even the overlay then reflects the progress depending on the player that's currently viewed.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## The most notable additions/features of this update include, but are not limited to:\r\n\r\n### COOP:\r\n* Full coop support through either Advancely's official server or locally through LAN/VPN. \r\n* Template mismatch detection within a lobby. Every receiver must use the functional template as the receiver. _More info on that [here](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely#co-op-multiplayer) if you open the dropdown and scroll down to `Template Matching`._\r\n* Coop goal merging rules. \r\n* A per-player dropdown allowing a completely isolated progress view for a certain player.\r\n* **Full Hermes support**. \r\n* Legacy version (<=1.6.4) support (even with the `StatsPerWorld` Mod)\r\n* Craftmine/unlocks support for coop.\r\n* Online/Offline account support, UUID validation, so Advancely knows exactly which stats/advancements/unlocks file belongs to your player. _This fixes an issue with Singleplayer worlds that others have already played on, so Advancely wouldn't read the wrong files._\r\n\r\n_Find the full coop documentation [here](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely#co-op-multiplayer)._\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n### Other:\r\n* Added error on duplicate hotkeys.\r\n* After a manual trigger (checkbox or custom counter) Advancely now re-reads the last 5 minutes of the Hermes log to assure it accuracy, despite being ahead of the main game files.\r\n* Added two new timer formatting options into the overlay settings to add spacing in front of the unit or to always show milliseconds.\r\n* Supporters are now permanently visible at the bottom of the settings window sorted by donation amount.\r\n* Fixed browser links opening twice on windows.\r\n* Added **Report Issue** button to the settings, that links directly to the [Official Advancely Discord](https://discord.gg/TyNgXDz). _If you find any issues, please contact me through there._\r\n* New `--relay-test` CLI flag for one-shot TLS + cert-pin connectivity check\r\n* ScambledMC updated the amazing `1.16` `all_advancements` `_categorical` template.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}